3. PATIENT-SPECIFIC GEOMETRY RECONSTRUCTION
======================================================================

Patient-specific ventricular geometry was derived from the corresponding
segmentation masks.

The controlled reconstruction workflow comprises:

1. Source-image and segmentation identification
2. Segmentation verification
3. Three-dimensional surface reconstruction
4. Surface quality-control assessment
