4. FINITE-ELEMENT DOMAIN
======================================================================

Patient-specific ventricular geometries are converted into three-dimensional
volumetric finite-element domains.

The primary discretization uses three-dimensional tetrahedral finite
elements.

Three mesh refinement levels are defined:

- coarse
- medium
- fine

Mesh generation and reconstruction procedures are documented in:

03_Geometry_Reconstruction/

and

05_COMSOL_Model/

Mesh-quality and mesh-independence verification are controlled through:

09_Stage_3_Verification/

Mesh convergence must be demonstrated using the actual executed mesh
realizations and corresponding output quantities.

A previously documented convergence percentage must not be represented as
verified unless its underlying mesh-comparison artifact can be recovered or
reproduced.

