9. CAVITY LOADING
======================================================================

Intracavitary loading is represented using the ventricular pressure
condition specified by the implemented model.

The exact pressure value and implementation must be obtained from the
executed model or authoritative model-parameter record.

The current recovery does not establish an exact historical numerical
